## Model card

- **Name:** DeepSeek V4 Vision Exp (unverified shortened identity)
- **Short description:** The folder name omits **Flash** from DeepSeek's actual experimental vision model name. There is no evidence that a non-Flash V4 Vision Exp checkpoint was released. Do not score the Flash checkpoint as a different model merely to fill this folder.
- **Provider / access:** No verified first-party `deepseek-v4-vision-exp` API ID. DeepSeek's [August 21 change log](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/updates) explicitly names `deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp`; its [vision guide](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/vision) and [current pricing page](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing) use the same full ID. OpenRouter also lists the [full Flash ID](https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp), not this shortened name.
- **Release / knowledge:** No distinct release date or knowledge cutoff for the shortened name. The full **Flash** experiment launched 2026-08-21 and was retired 2026-09-10 ([DeepSeek change log](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/updates)).
- **IDs:** `deepseek-v4-vision-exp` unverified. The historical `deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp` is a *different spelling* which DeepSeek says now routes to `deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017` rather than the retired checkpoint. API calls today cannot test the historical vision experiment ([pricing and alias note](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing)).
- **Context window:** No verified context specifically for this shortened ID. [OpenRouter's historical Flash Vision profile](https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp) lists 1,048,576 input-context / up to 262,144 completion tokens for the **full** ID; this cannot establish a separate non-Flash model.
- **Modalities:** Not independently verified for this shortened ID; the documented **Flash** experiment supported text and image input, text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-31):** No verified price for a distinct shortened-ID checkpoint. DeepSeek's [current Flash price](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing) applies to the **successor** serving the retired Flash Vision alias, not necessarily to August's historical experimental weights.
- **Architecture:** No distinct public checkpoint, parameter count or license verified.

